		(property "Notes" "Replaces the TPD2S300 DSBGA (2026-10-14, 6-layer board with 0.3 mm vias). Wiring as TI TPS25751EVM fig. 5-5: CC and SBU both pass through it; RPD_G1/2 to C_CC1/2 (dead-battery Rd, DRP); VPWR 1 uF, VBIAS 0.1 uF 50 V; FLT -> GPIO3. Place close to the connector"
			(at 121.92 160.02 0)
